cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use these colourings, formulas or programs, please cite them as below, together with Gyarfas and Raeisi (Electron. J. Combin. 19(2) 2012, #P30)."
type: dataset
title: "Multicolour Ramsey numbers of the 3-uniform loose triangle: R_4(C_3;3) = 9 and R_5(C_3;3) = 11"
abstract: "R_4(C_3;3) = 9 and R_5(C_3;3) = 11 for the 3-uniform loose triangle, R_12(C_3;3) >= 19, and R_r(C_3;3) - r unbounded: explicit colourings checked by two programs, SAT proofs (DRAT and LRAT, cake_lpr) with formulas built identically by two generators, and an 18,129-leaf cube-and-conquer record. Not yet peer reviewed."
